{"videoId":"Zd8K5CI-Y1A","source":"auto","lang":"en","sentences":[{"start":0.1,"end":3.0,"text":"Want to speak real English from your first lesson?"},{"start":3.0,"end":8.6,"text":"Sign up for your free lifetime account at Englishclass101.com."},{"start":8.6,"end":10.0,"text":">> Hi, I'm Daphne,"},{"start":10.0,"end":11.3,"text":"and welcome"},{"start":11.3,"end":13.5,"text":"to this lesson."},{"start":13.5,"end":16.4,"text":"In this lesson, we will be learning"},{"start":16.4,"end":17.1,"text":"about"},{"start":17.1,"end":18.5,"text":"in versus"},{"start":18.5,"end":20.2,"text":"in to."},{"start":20.2,"end":23.1,"text":"Before we get started with the lesson,"},{"start":23.1,"end":29.6,"text":"please feel free to like, comment, and subscribe to our channel if you enjoy our content."},{"start":29.6,"end":32.0,"text":"And we also have many resources"},{"start":32.0,"end":33.1,"text":"for you."},{"start":33.1,"end":34.6,"text":"We have some PDF"},{"start":34.6,"end":37.1,"text":"cheat sheets that you can download completely"},{"start":37.1,"end":38.2,"text":"for free."},{"start":38.2,"end":42.5,"text":"All you have to do is click that link in the description box below,"},{"start":42.5,"end":46.4,"text":"and that will lead you to download your PDF cheat sheets."},{"start":46.4,"end":49.9,"text":"And you can use these in your free time to study"},{"start":49.9,"end":51.1,"text":"English."},{"start":51.1,"end":52.9,"text":"Okay, so"},{"start":52.9,"end":58.8,"text":"today's lesson, like I just mentioned, is in versus in to and the differences"},{"start":58.8,"end":60.5,"text":"and when to use"},{"start":60.5,"end":62.0,"text":"each one."},{"start":62.0,"end":63.6,"text":"So let's start with"},{"start":63.6,"end":64.9,"text":"in,"},{"start":64.9,"end":66.2,"text":"which usually"},{"start":66.2,"end":68.7,"text":"we use for a location"},{"start":68.7,"end":70.8,"text":"or a position."},{"start":70.8,"end":73.3,"text":"So here I wrote out"},{"start":73.3,"end":74.0,"text":"when"},{"start":74.0,"end":77.0,"text":"you would use in. So you use in"},{"start":77.0,"end":78.7,"text":"when you mean that a person,"},{"start":78.7,"end":81.0,"text":"place, thing, or animal"},{"start":81.0,"end":81.9,"text":"is located"},{"start":81.9,"end":82.8,"text":"inside"},{"start":82.8,"end":84.2,"text":"a specific location,"},{"start":84.2,"end":85.5,"text":"inside something"},{"start":85.5,"end":88.0,"text":"or a location."},{"start":88.0,"end":89.8,"text":"So here are some examples"},{"start":89.8,"end":92.9,"text":"written out, and there are definitely more examples"},{"start":92.9,"end":94.4,"text":"than what's on the board,"},{"start":94.4,"end":98.0,"text":"but these are just a couple that I wrote out."},{"start":98.0,"end":100.9,"text":"So the first example we have is"},{"start":100.9,"end":102.1,"text":"the toys"},{"start":102.1,"end":103.6,"text":"are in"},{"start":103.6,"end":105.0,"text":"the box."},{"start":105.0,"end":108.0,"text":"So the toys, they are located"},{"start":108.0,"end":108.8,"text":"in"},{"start":108.8,"end":111.3,"text":"the box. So their position, their location"},{"start":111.3,"end":113.1,"text":"is inside"},{"start":113.1,"end":114.4,"text":"the box."},{"start":114.4,"end":118.2,"text":"So usually if you have a lot of toys, you might put them somewhere, and in this"},{"start":118.2,"end":120.99,"text":"case, in box."},{"start":120.99,"end":122.29,"text":"Next, we have"},{"start":122.29,"end":124.29,"text":"she is in"},{"start":124.29,"end":125.89,"text":"the classroom."},{"start":125.89,"end":129.59,"text":"So, where is her location?"},{"start":129.59,"end":133.29,"text":"In the classroom. So, she is inside the classroom."},{"start":133.29,"end":138.69,"text":"So, maybe you're asking where your friend is. Oh, she is inside the classroom."},{"start":138.69,"end":141.09,"text":"Next, we have he lives"},{"start":141.09,"end":142.19,"text":"in"},{"start":142.19,"end":143.69,"text":"New York."},{"start":143.69,"end":146.29,"text":"So, this location is bigger."},{"start":146.29,"end":148.49,"text":"And where is that location?"},{"start":148.49,"end":154.89,"text":"New York. So, he lives in New York. I currently live in Japan."},{"start":154.89,"end":160.09,"text":"You might live in a different country or you might also live in Japan."},{"start":160.09,"end":163.89,"text":"Next, we have I was already in"},{"start":163.89,"end":168.59,"text":"the stadium. So, maybe you and your friend are meeting up for a baseball game"},{"start":168.59,"end":172.89,"text":"and you plan to meet up outside, but your friend was taking too long. So, you"},{"start":172.89,"end":177.99,"text":"could say I was already in the stadium by the time you arrived."},{"start":177.99,"end":181.69,"text":"Then we have this example right here which says"},{"start":181.69,"end":183.69,"text":"she was in"},{"start":183.69,"end":185.29,"text":"the hospital"},{"start":185.29,"end":187.79,"text":"for a week. So, where is her location,"},{"start":187.79,"end":188.99,"text":"position?"},{"start":188.99,"end":192.59,"text":"The hospital. So, she was in a hospital"},{"start":192.59,"end":193.69,"text":"for"},{"start":193.69,"end":194.69,"text":"a week."},{"start":194.69,"end":199.49,"text":"So, maybe she got into a car crash or there was an accident."},{"start":199.49,"end":200.69,"text":"So, unfortunately,"},{"start":200.69,"end":202.49,"text":"she had to stay"},{"start":202.49,"end":203.49,"text":"in the hospital"},{"start":203.49,"end":204.99,"text":"for a week."},{"start":204.99,"end":209.49,"text":"Hopefully, that never happens to you, but I've had to stay in the hospital for a"},{"start":209.49,"end":211.29,"text":"little over a week"},{"start":211.29,"end":212.99,"text":"because I had appendicitis."},{"start":212.99,"end":213.89,"text":"Unfortunately,"},{"start":213.89,"end":215.19,"text":"that is"},{"start":215.19,"end":217.29,"text":"very painful."},{"start":217.29,"end":218.79,"text":"But"},{"start":218.79,"end":223.89,"text":"over here, what we have written out with this little star is just something to keep"},{"start":223.89,"end":225.39,"text":"in mind"},{"start":225.39,"end":227.89,"text":"which is in"},{"start":227.89,"end":229.89,"text":"you can use to also indicate"},{"start":229.89,"end":231.49,"text":"something"},{"start":231.49,"end":233.29,"text":"that rests within"},{"start":233.29,"end":234.49,"text":"an object"},{"start":234.49,"end":236.39,"text":"or an idea."},{"start":236.39,"end":240.19,"text":"So, in this case, the example I have written is"},{"start":240.19,"end":241.19,"text":"the key"},{"start":241.19,"end":242.59,"text":"lies in"},{"start":242.59,"end":243.39,"text":"understanding"},{"start":243.39,"end":244.49,"text":"her true"},{"start":244.49,"end":246.09,"text":"motivations."},{"start":246.09,"end":248.99,"text":"So the idea"},{"start":248.99,"end":250.69,"text":"is"},{"start":250.69,"end":255.49,"text":"the key lies in the idea of understanding"},{"start":255.49,"end":256.49,"text":"her true"},{"start":256.49,"end":257.99,"text":"motivations."},{"start":257.99,"end":259.69,"text":"You might also"},{"start":259.69,"end":262.09,"text":"have an example like the value"},{"start":262.09,"end":266.09,"text":"lies in. So the value lies in"},{"start":266.09,"end":268.49,"text":"how well you complete"},{"start":268.49,"end":269.89,"text":"the assignment,"},{"start":269.89,"end":271.09,"text":"for example."},{"start":271.09,"end":274.09,"text":"So that's another way that you can use"},{"start":274.09,"end":275.99,"text":"in."},{"start":275.99,"end":280.49,"text":"Next, we will move on to the uses"},{"start":280.49,"end":282.59,"text":"of into."},{"start":282.59,"end":286.39,"text":"So into usually is used for movement,"},{"start":286.39,"end":287.89,"text":"change."},{"start":287.89,"end":290.69,"text":"So for example,"},{"start":290.69,"end":295.39,"text":"um what I have written on the board here to explain that is you use into to"},{"start":295.39,"end":297.99,"text":"talk about the movement"},{"start":297.99,"end":299.59,"text":"of something."},{"start":299.59,"end":302.09,"text":"So in"},{"start":302.09,"end":306.29,"text":"it's in this case right here, the example, the toys are in the box. It's not"},{"start":306.29,"end":308.89,"text":"moving. They are just inside the box."},{"start":308.89,"end":312.99,"text":"But maybe you want to put your toys into"},{"start":312.99,"end":315.39,"text":"the box. So the toys are moving,"},{"start":315.39,"end":316.89,"text":"going towards"},{"start":316.89,"end":318.39,"text":"the box, inside"},{"start":318.39,"end":320.09,"text":"the box."},{"start":320.09,"end":321.79,"text":"Okay, now"},{"start":321.79,"end":326.19,"text":"simply we use into to talk about the movement"},{"start":326.19,"end":327.59,"text":"of something."},{"start":327.59,"end":329.99,"text":"So here I have some examples"},{"start":329.99,"end":331.59,"text":"written out."},{"start":331.59,"end":333.29,"text":"So he came"},{"start":333.29,"end":334.49,"text":"into"},{"start":334.49,"end":335.79,"text":"the room."},{"start":335.79,"end":337.49,"text":"So in this case,"},{"start":337.49,"end":338.49,"text":"he is"},{"start":338.49,"end":339.39,"text":"walking,"},{"start":339.39,"end":341.09,"text":"going into"},{"start":341.09,"end":344.49,"text":"the room. So that's the movement. He came into"},{"start":344.49,"end":346.29,"text":"the room."},{"start":346.29,"end":348.79,"text":"Next, we have he jumped into"},{"start":348.79,"end":350.09,"text":"the pool."},{"start":350.09,"end":352.69,"text":"So the movement is jumping into"},{"start":352.69,"end":354.19,"text":"the pool. So"},{"start":354.19,"end":358.19,"text":"maybe you're at a pool party and you want to get wet, so"},{"start":358.19,"end":360.49,"text":"you're jumping or he is jumping"},{"start":360.49,"end":361.29,"text":"into"},{"start":361.29,"end":362.89,"text":"the pool."},{"start":362.89,"end":364.39,"text":"Next, we have"},{"start":364.39,"end":366.19,"text":"the caterpillar"},{"start":366.19,"end":367.09,"text":"turned"},{"start":367.09,"end":368.39,"text":"into"},{"start":368.39,"end":369.69,"text":"a butterfly."},{"start":369.69,"end":372.39,"text":"So that is some kind of change."},{"start":372.39,"end":373.6,"text":"So the caterpillar"},{"start":373.6,"end":375.3,"text":"turned into"},{"start":375.3,"end":377.0,"text":"a butterfly. So"},{"start":377.0,"end":378.0,"text":"the movement,"},{"start":378.0,"end":380.69,"text":"the change that is happening is the caterpillar"},{"start":380.69,"end":382.5,"text":"is now becoming"},{"start":382.5,"end":384.39,"text":"a butterfly."},{"start":384.39,"end":388.89,"text":"Then we have this example. She walked into"},{"start":388.89,"end":390.0,"text":"the store."},{"start":390.0,"end":391.5,"text":"So maybe you"},{"start":391.5,"end":392.39,"text":"are"},{"start":392.39,"end":397.5,"text":"going grocery shopping. So she walked in to the grocery store."},{"start":397.5,"end":400.5,"text":"Then we have he dived into"},{"start":400.5,"end":401.6,"text":"the water."},{"start":401.6,"end":402.5,"text":"So maybe"},{"start":402.5,"end":403.69,"text":"he's"},{"start":403.69,"end":406.9,"text":"at the beach and then he sees somebody drowning."},{"start":406.9,"end":410.9,"text":"So he immediately dives into the water"},{"start":410.9,"end":414.5,"text":"to try and help the person."},{"start":414.5,"end":419.5,"text":"So here the difference between into versus in in"},{"start":419.5,"end":423.8,"text":"this is not moving. It's just in a specific location."},{"start":423.8,"end":425.19,"text":"So for example,"},{"start":425.19,"end":429.19,"text":"the toys are in the box. They are inside the box."},{"start":429.19,"end":431.1,"text":"But if there is movement,"},{"start":431.1,"end":435.0,"text":"you can say I am putting the toys into the box."},{"start":435.0,"end":436.1,"text":"So they are moving"},{"start":436.1,"end":436.89,"text":"into"},{"start":436.89,"end":437.89,"text":"the box."},{"start":437.89,"end":443.8,"text":"So that's why into usually is used for movement or some kind of change."},{"start":443.8,"end":446.1,"text":"So we can also use into"},{"start":446.1,"end":447.4,"text":"to signify"},{"start":447.4,"end":449.5,"text":"high level of interest"},{"start":449.5,"end":451.39,"text":"or enthusiasm."},{"start":451.39,"end":454.1,"text":"So some of the examples I have here,"},{"start":454.1,"end":457.89,"text":"number one being he's really into her."},{"start":457.89,"end":459.89,"text":"So this shows that he"},{"start":459.89,"end":461.5,"text":"has interest,"},{"start":461.5,"end":463.69,"text":"enthusiasm"},{"start":463.69,"end":467.8,"text":"for about her. So he's into her."},{"start":467.8,"end":471.6,"text":"Or maybe you could say she's really into"},{"start":471.6,"end":474.6,"text":"jazz. That means that she's very much interested"},{"start":474.6,"end":480.1,"text":"in jazz music. She likes jazz music. She has enthusiasm"},{"start":480.1,"end":482.09,"text":"for jazz music. So she's"},{"start":482.09,"end":483.59,"text":"really into"},{"start":483.59,"end":484.69,"text":"jazz."},{"start":484.69,"end":486.0,"text":"Or I'm"},{"start":486.0,"end":491.7,"text":"into reading a lot these days. So lately I have been reading a lot of books."},{"start":491.7,"end":494.6,"text":"So my interest is reading books."},{"start":494.6,"end":496.4,"text":"So I'm into reading"},{"start":496.4,"end":498.7,"text":"a lot of books."},{"start":498.7,"end":501.4,"text":"And again into as a change"},{"start":501.4,"end":502.7,"text":"in something"},{"start":502.7,"end":504.3,"text":"or someone."},{"start":504.3,"end":505.8,"text":"So similar to"},{"start":505.8,"end":508.1,"text":"or like this butterfly"},{"start":508.1,"end":510.1,"text":"caterpillar example."},{"start":510.1,"end":511.1,"text":"So"},{"start":511.1,"end":512.2,"text":"he changed"},{"start":512.2,"end":514.3,"text":"into his uniform."},{"start":514.3,"end":518.1,"text":"So the change that is happening is his outfit. So maybe"},{"start":518.1,"end":521.5,"text":"he is going to work or going to school."},{"start":521.5,"end":522.8,"text":"So he changed"},{"start":522.8,"end":526.2,"text":"into his uniform."},{"start":526.2,"end":528.2,"text":"Then we have this example."},{"start":528.2,"end":529.7,"text":"They cut the pizza"},{"start":529.7,"end":531.9,"text":"into eight slices."},{"start":531.9,"end":537.3,"text":"So the change that is happening here is the state of the pizza. So initially when"},{"start":537.3,"end":540.5,"text":"you bake a pizza it's usually in a big big pie like this."},{"start":540.5,"end":541.5,"text":"So then"},{"start":541.5,"end":543.5,"text":"they will cut it"},{"start":543.5,"end":544.6,"text":"into slices."},{"start":544.6,"end":545.9,"text":"So in this case"},{"start":545.9,"end":548.9,"text":"they cut the pizza into eight slices."},{"start":548.9,"end":554.5,"text":"You can cut a cake into eight slices, into six slices, however many slices you'd like."},{"start":554.5,"end":556.0,"text":"So that's the change."},{"start":556.0,"end":558.3,"text":"It's going from"},{"start":558.3,"end":559.3,"text":"one state"},{"start":559.3,"end":562.3,"text":"to another. So the pizza as a whole"},{"start":562.3,"end":563.6,"text":"into slices"},{"start":563.6,"end":565.4,"text":"or the cake as a whole"},{"start":565.4,"end":566.5,"text":"into"},{"start":566.5,"end":568.7,"text":"slices."},{"start":568.7,"end":570.4,"text":"And before we continue"},{"start":570.4,"end":572.4,"text":"with the rest of our lesson,"},{"start":572.4,"end":576.3,"text":"please feel free to check out our free PDF"},{"start":576.3,"end":577.4,"text":"cheat sheets."},{"start":577.4,"end":581.4,"text":"All you have to do is click that link in the description"},{"start":581.4,"end":585.7,"text":"and that will bring you to download your free PDF cheat sheets."},{"start":585.7,"end":590.9,"text":"This is a great tool for you studying English. So please feel free to check those"},{"start":590.9,"end":591.9,"text":"out."},{"start":591.9,"end":592.6,"text":"Okay,"},{"start":592.6,"end":596.9,"text":"for the rest of our lesson on this side of the board right here,"},{"start":596.9,"end":600.3,"text":"these are just some things to also keep in mind."},{"start":600.3,"end":602.0,"text":"So sometimes"},{"start":602.0,"end":602.9,"text":"there are cases"},{"start":602.9,"end":605.8,"text":"where both in and into can be used"},{"start":605.8,"end":607.8,"text":"to show motion and direction."},{"start":607.8,"end":611.5,"text":"So they really have the same meaning essentially."},{"start":611.5,"end":613.0,"text":"So some of the examples"},{"start":613.0,"end":616.1,"text":"I have written out here are her phone"},{"start":616.1,"end":618.4,"text":"fell in the river."},{"start":618.4,"end":621.2,"text":"So her phone is essentially"},{"start":621.2,"end":622.0,"text":"moving,"},{"start":622.0,"end":623.2,"text":"falling"},{"start":623.2,"end":624.5,"text":"and it fell"},{"start":624.5,"end":627.3,"text":"in the river. So it has a very"},{"start":627.3,"end":631.4,"text":"much similar meaning too. Her phone fell into"},{"start":631.4,"end":632.4,"text":"the river."},{"start":632.4,"end":634.2,"text":"So her phone"},{"start":634.2,"end":636.4,"text":"is moving, falling into"},{"start":636.4,"end":637.7,"text":"the river. So sometimes"},{"start":637.7,"end":641.0,"text":"people like to use these interchangeably."},{"start":641.0,"end":642.1,"text":"There are very"},{"start":642.1,"end":647.3,"text":"small nuance differences, but in general, if you said either sentence,"},{"start":647.3,"end":648.7,"text":"people would understand"},{"start":648.7,"end":650.1,"text":"what you are saying."},{"start":650.1,"end":654.5,"text":"So the next example I have is can you put the milk"},{"start":654.5,"end":656.0,"text":"in the fridge?"},{"start":656.0,"end":657.3,"text":"So you're putting,"},{"start":657.3,"end":658.7,"text":"moving the milk"},{"start":658.7,"end":661.5,"text":"from outside of the fridge to"},{"start":661.5,"end":662.4,"text":"inside"},{"start":662.4,"end":663.3,"text":"the fridge."},{"start":663.3,"end":666.7,"text":"So can you put the milk in the fridge? Can you put the eggs in the"},{"start":666.7,"end":667.5,"text":"fridge?"},{"start":667.5,"end":671.5,"text":"And some other people might say can you put the milk into"},{"start":671.5,"end":672.8,"text":"the fridge? So again,"},{"start":672.8,"end":674.0,"text":"there is movement."},{"start":674.0,"end":677.0,"text":"The milk is going from outside of the refrigerator"},{"start":677.0,"end":678.2,"text":"to inside"},{"start":678.2,"end":680.9,"text":"the refrigerator. So into the fridge."},{"start":680.9,"end":684.7,"text":"And people might say either one and they essentially"},{"start":684.7,"end":686.5,"text":"mean the same thing."},{"start":686.5,"end":687.9,"text":"So that's important"},{"start":687.9,"end":689.8,"text":"to keep in mind."},{"start":689.8,"end":692.1,"text":"So another thing that is important"},{"start":692.1,"end":693.8,"text":"to keep in mind"},{"start":693.8,"end":696.6,"text":"is just the difference between into"},{"start":696.6,"end":697.6,"text":"as a preposition,"},{"start":697.6,"end":699.2,"text":"so one word into"},{"start":699.2,"end":701.2,"text":"versus in"},{"start":701.2,"end":702.1,"text":"to"},{"start":702.1,"end":704.3,"text":"two words that just so happen"},{"start":704.3,"end":706.1,"text":"to be next to each other,"},{"start":706.1,"end":708.1,"text":"but they sound very similar"},{"start":708.1,"end":710.5,"text":"but have a different meaning."},{"start":710.5,"end":711.3,"text":"So"},{"start":711.3,"end":714.7,"text":"the example I have written on the board is"},{"start":714.7,"end":717.6,"text":"I dropped in to say hello."},{"start":717.6,"end":720.3,"text":"So that sounds like you are using"},{"start":720.3,"end":721.6,"text":"into"},{"start":721.6,"end":722.6,"text":"as a preposition,"},{"start":722.6,"end":723.4,"text":"but"},{"start":723.4,"end":727.9,"text":"they are actually two separate words that are next to each other, but"},{"start":727.9,"end":729.4,"text":"not"},{"start":729.4,"end":731.1,"text":"the word into."},{"start":731.1,"end":733.0,"text":"So I dropped in"},{"start":733.0,"end":733.7,"text":"is"},{"start":733.7,"end":735.9,"text":"the phrasal verb."},{"start":735.9,"end":738.0,"text":"And then to"},{"start":738.0,"end":740.0,"text":"is part of the infinitive"},{"start":740.0,"end":743.6,"text":"of to say. So you have the sentence I dropped"},{"start":743.6,"end":744.9,"text":"in"},{"start":744.9,"end":746.1,"text":"to say"},{"start":746.1,"end":747.3,"text":"hello."},{"start":747.3,"end":749.9,"text":"And it is not I dropped into"},{"start":749.9,"end":752.3,"text":"say hello. That is incorrect."},{"start":752.3,"end":756.7,"text":"So please keep that in mind."},{"start":756.7,"end":759.9,"text":"And the last little section I have here is"},{"start":759.9,"end":762.0,"text":"just a quick comparison"},{"start":762.0,"end":764.4,"text":"of in versus into."},{"start":764.4,"end":765.3,"text":"So"},{"start":765.3,"end":770.0,"text":"the first sentence says she's gone for a walk in the garden,"},{"start":770.0,"end":771.3,"text":"which means"},{"start":771.3,"end":773.3,"text":"she is inside"},{"start":773.3,"end":774.9,"text":"the garden"},{"start":774.9,"end":775.7,"text":"walking."},{"start":775.7,"end":778.2,"text":"So she's gone for a walk in the garden."},{"start":778.2,"end":780.6,"text":"Then we have she walked into"},{"start":780.6,"end":782.0,"text":"the garden,"},{"start":782.0,"end":786.3,"text":"which means that she went from not being in the garden"},{"start":786.3,"end":787.3,"text":"to entering"},{"start":787.3,"end":789.7,"text":"the garden. So she entered the garden."},{"start":789.7,"end":792.4,"text":"That's why we say she walked into"},{"start":792.4,"end":793.4,"text":"the garden."},{"start":793.4,"end":794.8,"text":"So these are just"},{"start":794.8,"end":796.2,"text":"some differences"},{"start":796.2,"end":797.0,"text":"and"},{"start":797.0,"end":798.3,"text":"again, hopefully"},{"start":798.3,"end":802.6,"text":"you learned how to use in versus into."},{"start":802.6,"end":805.6,"text":"So in is for a location"},{"start":805.6,"end":806.6,"text":"or a position."},{"start":806.6,"end":809.2,"text":"So it's not necessarily moving."},{"start":809.2,"end":812.3,"text":"So the toys are in the box."},{"start":812.3,"end":813.1,"text":"Into"},{"start":813.1,"end":816.3,"text":"is some kind of movement or change."},{"start":816.3,"end":818.9,"text":"You are putting your toys into"},{"start":818.9,"end":821.2,"text":"the box. He came into"},{"start":821.2,"end":822.4,"text":"the room"},{"start":822.4,"end":824.8,"text":"or maybe in"},{"start":824.8,"end":826.8,"text":"a change. We have the caterpillar"},{"start":826.8,"end":828.5,"text":"turned into"},{"start":828.5,"end":830.1,"text":"a butterfly."},{"start":830.1,"end":831.8,"text":"Or you are translating"},{"start":831.8,"end":833.0,"text":"this English"},{"start":833.0,"end":834.4,"text":"text into"},{"start":834.4,"end":835.5,"text":"Spanish."},{"start":835.5,"end":837.9,"text":"So it's going from being English"},{"start":837.9,"end":839.3,"text":"to Spanish."},{"start":839.3,"end":841.0,"text":"So that is the change."},{"start":841.0,"end":841.9,"text":"So hopefully"},{"start":841.9,"end":842.7,"text":"you"},{"start":842.7,"end":843.9,"text":"now understand"},{"start":843.9,"end":846.3,"text":"the difference between in versus"},{"start":846.3,"end":847.6,"text":"into."},{"start":847.6,"end":850.3,"text":"And we also have many resources"},{"start":850.3,"end":851.2,"text":"for you."},{"start":851.2,"end":853.0,"text":"We have some free PDF"},{"start":853.0,"end":857.3,"text":"cheat sheets that you can download. All you have to do is click that link in"},{"start":857.3,"end":858.6,"text":"the description"},{"start":858.6,"end":863.0,"text":"and that will bring you to download your free PDF cheat sheets."},{"start":863.0,"end":864.8,"text":"We have many topics."},{"start":864.8,"end":868.2,"text":"Please feel free to check those out."},{"start":868.2,"end":869.1,"text":"So hopefully"},{"start":869.1,"end":871.1,"text":"you enjoyed today's lesson"},{"start":871.1,"end":875.9,"text":"and I will see you all next time."},{"start":875.9,"end":877.8,"text":">> Want to speed up your language learning?"},{"start":877.8,"end":883.4,"text":"Take your very first lesson with us. You'll start speaking in minutes and master real conversations."},{"start":883.4,"end":885.4,"text":"Sign up for your free lifetime account."},{"start":885.4,"end":887.1,"text":"Just click the link in the description."}]}